          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 32,
          "bbox": [
            0.518,
            0.378,
            0.892,
            0.424
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "plebeian in the Roman Republic, a social class made up of minor landholders, craftspeople, merchants, and small farmers (p. 152)"
