        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 35,
          "bbox": [
            0.522,
            0.468,
            0.896,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "policy of containment a plan to keep something, such as communism, within its existing geographical boundaries and prevent further aggressive moves (p. 850)"
