        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 39,
          "bbox": [
            0.529,
            0.601,
            0.902,
            0.646
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "pop art an artistic movement that emerged in the early 1960s; pop artists took images from popular culture and transformed them into works of fine art (p. 892)"
